a\n50\t\n51\t- A written GA-readiness assessment exists that inventories gaps across API\n52\t  stability, upgrade paths, scale limits, and error handling, with each gap\n53\t  assigned a severity and a GA-bar delta.\n54\t- Tech Preview feedback from support tickets is reviewed and represented in\n55\t  the gap inventory (each ticket theme either maps to a gap or is explicitly\n56\t  dispositioned as not GA-blocking).\n57\t- The assessment outputs a definitive GA scope list, with each scope item\n58\t  mapped to a downstream work area (API stability, support posture, or\n59\t  already-met/verify-only).\n60\t- The API stability and support posture workstreams can be sized from the\n61\t  assessment: each relevant scope item carries an effort estimate or size\n62\t  range.\n63\t- Every gap in the inventory is either in the GA scope, dispositioned as\n64\t  deferred with rationale, or marked already-met with the verification\n65\t  evidence needed.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- **HLR-1 (P0)**: A GA-readiness assessment inventories the gaps between\n70\t  current TP quality and GA bar (API stability, upgrade paths, scale limits,\n71\t  error handling), producing the definitive GA scope. This epic is that\n72\t  assessment.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bbef671f2f1c4d7e","agent_id":"a949b8667dcb016b9","session_id":"e26389fa-88dc-429a-9f52-aa484b1f6aa7","uuid":"37f48502-2db5-4fc0-87b2-d26437cd60a7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:52:10.098Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9930d1a882f935eb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
