{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aba63609e1aaebb9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9014-E001\n3\ttitle: GA-readiness assessment for Llama Stack\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9014\n5\tcomponent: Llama Stack\n6\tteam: RHOAI GenAI\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tinvestigation_signals:\n11\t  question_specificity: 1\n12\t  source_accessibility: 1\n13\t  local_runnability: 1\n14\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: -1\n15\t  human_judgment_required: -1\n16\timplementation_type: null\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Medium\n19\tai_implementability_score: 1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# GA-readiness assessment for Llama Stack\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis epic resolves the strategy's core unknown: the full inventory of gaps\n30\tbetween current Tech Preview quality and the GA bar for Llama Stack. It\n31\tproduces the definitive GA scope that all stability and hardening work is\n32\tsized against. Until this assessment lands, the size of the GA work is an\n33\testimate (the strategy's only open question).\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Inventory gaps between current Tech Preview quality and the GA bar across\n38\t  the four areas named by the strategy: API stability, upgrade paths, scale\n39\t  limits, and error handling.\n40\t- Consolidate Tech Preview feedback scattered across support tickets into the\n41\t  gap inventory.\n42\t- For each gap, record severity, the delta to the GA bar, and the affected\n43\t  surface (API, distribution, operator).\n44\t- Produce the definitive GA scope: a prioritized list of gaps that must close\n45\t  for GA, mapped to work areas (API stability work, support posture work), so\n46\t  each downstream workstream can be sized.\n47\t- Identify gaps that are already met and need only verification evidence.\n48\t\n49\t## Acceptance Criteri