her than exceptional.\n87\t  If the assessment finds the API surface already substantially meets the\n88\t  bar, this epic narrows to deprecation-policy publication and upgrade-path\n89\t  testing only.\n90\t- Re-split trigger: if the assessment's API-stability scope exceeds one\n91\t  sprint of estimated effort for this workstream, re-split along the\n92\t  assessment's gap categories (e.g., API versioning/deprecation policy vs.\n93\t  upgrade-path implementation and testing) so no epic exceeds the ~2-week\n94\t  guideline.\n95\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b03c5b8988ba3b1","agent_id":"a19fbb2abe9512236","session_id":"e26389fa-88dc-429a-9f52-aa484b1f6aa7","uuid":"b6b28f63-3ad1-4c20-9e47-10333e404deb","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:59:44.510Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-90a924587f091ccf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
